This repository includes a geometry-only adaptation of the CED keypoint detector:

  H. Teng, D. Chatziparaschis, X. Kan, A. K. Roy-Chowdhury and K. Karydis,
  "Centroid Distance Keypoint Detector for Colored Point Clouds",
  IEEE/CVF Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision (WACV), 2023.
  https://github.com/UCR-Robotics/CED_Detector

